{1}{[The creature before you is covered in scales, with a large mouth full of sharp teeth, and eyes of the coldest silver  Various tattoos cover much of its body.]  Warm-blood betrayer.  Offspring murderer.  What brings you here?  What death do you bring?  What lies will you tell?  Kan Kerai stands before you.  My power is greater than yours...}{[The creature before you is covered in scales, with a large mouth full of sharp teeth, and eyes of the coldest silver  Various tattoos cover much of its body.]  Warm-blood betrayer.  Offspring murderer.  What brings you here?  What death do you bring?  What lies will you tell?  Kan Kerai stands before you.  My power is greater than yours...}{}{}{}{ru2130}
