{218}{Ah.  You say the warm-blood heart is alone, and beats alone.  I can see why elves might be good, but men evil.  But how are some MEN good and others evil?  Is the blood that flows in your veins not the same blood?   Do you not dream the same dream?}{Ah.  You say the warm-blood heart is alone, and beats alone.  I can see why elves might be good, but men evil.  But how are some MEN good and others evil?  Is the blood that flows in your veins not the same blood?   Do you not dream the same dream?}{}{}{}{}
{219}{That is an important difference...men's hearts MAKE their dreams...}{}{5}{}{224}{}
{224}{[Kan Kerai ponders this for a moment.]  Interesting, @PCNAME@.  So these...poachers...as you call them, they dream an evil dream.  And so they kill our people.  But how am I to know that most men are not like them, that you are ALONE in your dream?}{[Kan Kerai ponders this for a moment.]  Interesting, @PCNAME@.  So these...poachers...as you call them, they dream an evil dream.  And so they kill our people.  But how am I to know that most men are not like them, that you are ALONE in your dream?}{}{}{}{}
{225}{You'll have to take my word for it...}{}{5}{}{292}{}
