{230}{No...nature is a harsh teacher.  Even among the Bedokaan, if there is one who does not hear the snake-fathers, or see the cold visions, then he is cast out or destroyed.  I would think that it is the same among warm-bloods...}{No...nature is a harsh teacher.  Even among the Bedokaan, if there is one who does not hear the snake-fathers, or see the cold visions, then he is cast out or destroyed.  I would think that it is the same among warm-bloods...}{}{}{}{}
