{236}{Perhaps, then, it is only these poachers that Kan Kerai must make war against.  If most men are like you, @PCNAME@, then perhaps the warm-blood ways are good ways.  I thank you for showing me this.  I am grateful.}{Perhaps, then, it is only these poachers that Kan Kerai must make war against.  If most men are like you, @PCNAME@, then perhaps the warm-blood ways are good ways.  I thank you for showing me this.  I am grateful.}{}{}{}{}
