{242}{Yes.  He is free to return to his home...make sure to speak with him before you leave and tell him he may leave.  I will make amends myself, and send gifts to the elves in the forest.  You have made peace between us, @PCNAME@...}{Yes.  He is free to return to his home...make sure to speak with him before you leave and tell him he may leave.  I will make amends myself, and send gifts to the elves in the forest.  You have made peace between us, @PCNAME@...}{}{}{}{gf2146 1, gf2692 1}
