{255}{I know not of many things outside the Dark Fens, but the Bedokaan are warriors, and we love this land as no other.  I offer the strength of my people, if you desire it.  In the village there is one named Waromon.  Speak with him, and if he so desires, you may take him on your quest.  He is brave, and knows the words of power...}{I know not of many things outside the Dark Fens, but the Bedokaan are warriors, and we love this land as no other.  I offer the strength of my people, if you desire it.  In the village there is one named Waromon.  Speak with him, and if he so desires, you may take him on your quest.  He is brave, and knows the words of power...}{}{}{}{ru 2132, gf2154 1}
